    {
      "name": "AyanBoss",
      "format": "glb",
      "position": [
        -119.93,
        -1.08,
        -0.12
      ],
      "rotation": [
        0.0,
        180.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "scale": [
        0.044,
        0.044,
        0.044
      ],
      "mass": 0.0,
      "use_gravity": false,
      "is_collideable": true,
      "is_kinematic": true,
      "collider_type": "capsule",
      "bounciness": 0.0,
      "friction": 0.5,
      "drag_linear": 0.02,
      "tag": "npc",
      "scripts": [
        "boss_npc"
      ],
      "casts_shadows": true,
      "receives_shadows": true,
      "is_trigger": false,
      "dialogue_data": {
        "start_node": "line_1",
        "nodes": {
          "line_1": {
            "speaker": "Ayan",
            "text": "You finally made it back to the top. Tell me... was the suit worth it? Or did you just need the armor to hide the coward underneath?",
            "choices": [
              {
                "text": "...",
                "next": "line_2"
              }
            ]
          },
          "line_2": {
            "speaker": "Ayan",
            "text": "My brother wasnt a saint, but he was mine. You put a bullet in him and ran. You lived like a rat in the walls while I spent every waking hour keeping this city from eating itself alive. You call my law \"tyranny\"? Look out that window. That smoke? Thats the \"freedom\" you brought back with you.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "text": "...",
                "next": "line_3"
              }
            ]
          },
          "line_3": {
            "speaker": "Ayan",
            "text": "I built a community out of the dirt, and you tore it down because you couldnt face a trial. You arent a liberator. Youre just a monster who broke the world because he was too afraid to hang for his crimes.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "text": "...",
                "next": "line_4"
              }
            ]
          },
          "line_4": {
            "speaker": "Ayan",
            "text": "(Looking the player in the eye)\n\"Go ahead. Finish it. But look around this room. Everything I worked for is gone. Youve won a kingdom of ash. Enjoy your seat, Rat.\"",
            "choices": [
              {
                "text": "Finish it.",
                "next": "exit",
                "action": "stand_up"
              }
            ]
          },
          "exit": {
            "text": ""
          },
          "phone_ending": {
            "text": "*phone ringing*",
            "next": "phone_ending_2"
          },
          "phone_ending_2": {
            "speaker": "Tony",
            "text": "The pizza you ordered is here!",
            "next": "exit"
          }
        }
      },
